# Play’Up web — qualité frontend

## Stack (intentional)

| Concern | Tool | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Format | **Prettier** | Not oxfmt/Biome; matches existing quotes/semis |
| Lint | **Oxlint** | Keep; do **not** add ESLint in parallel |
| Types | `tsc -b` (`npm run typecheck`) | Strict via `tsconfig` |
| CSS lint | none in CI | Rider warnings ≠ CI; Stylelint deferred |

## Commands

```bash
cd src/PlayUp/web
npm run format:check
npm run lint
npm run typecheck
npm run test:run
```

CI `web` job fails on **errors** from those steps (plus `build`). Oxlint warnings do not fail CI unless `--deny-warnings` is added later.

## Conventions

- Prettier: single quotes, trailing commas, semis, `printWidth` 80 (CSS 120)
- Prefer extracting non-component exports (helpers) over disabling `only-export-components`
- Form `onSubmit`: use `SubmitEvent`, not deprecated `FormEvent`
- Do not add Stylelint / ESLint without a demonstrated problem beyond IDE noise
- Source comments / JSDoc: English; current technical constraints only; no Notion / V1–MVP history — see `documentation.mdc`
